ast.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2004-10-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zCWDLe8WMDmuFYJzTlJJ4pMEGUR.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zCWDLe8WMDmuFYJzTlJJ4pMEGUR.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/27813/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"698890","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The return of the full moon has stirred Hazuki's thirst for blood. When Kouhei won't give her what she wants, the little vamp sets out on the hunt.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2004-10-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rMJy1VTcPSl1hT2bBU1scriB6mR.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rMJy1VTcPSl1hT2bBU1scriB6mR.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/27813/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"698891","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Elfriede, a servant of Count Kinkel, has come to retrieve Hazuki and return her to the castle. The little vampire proves to be less than agreeable, and a fierce and furry battle begins.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2004-11-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nWbyfRCPctoQo37fZny8JNuX9z4.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nWbyfRCPctoQo37fZny8JNuX9z4.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/27813/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"698892","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Kouhei's family, Hazuki, and Haiji seek mystical assistance at the Mido home in Kyoto. When Elfriede arranges a clandestine rendezvous with Kouhei, Hazuki steps in to set things straight.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2004-11-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5HGyTGZBkflacjmq1CdWLC9KzDZ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5HGyTGZBkflacjmq1CdWLC9KzDZ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/27813/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"698893","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Finding Kouhei a pitiful excuse for a slave, Hazuki uses her powers to brainwash another unsuspecting soul into following her every command. When Kouhei finds out, a painful fight ensues.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2004-11-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3rX4m8YVpgnAmtfTF11G24TwcHn.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3rX4m8YVpgnAmtfTF11G24TwcHn.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/27813/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"698894","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Hazuki finds herself unprotected after her hopes are painfully manipulated by Count Kinkel. Kouhei and his grandfather must charge into battle to save her.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2004-11-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hnRW2aDwqRCNgL6Pd39rpjRPNQY.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hnRW2aDwqRCNgL6Pd39rpjRPNQY.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/27813/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"698895","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"While Gramps and Elfriede join forces and take on Count Kinkel, Kouhei finds Hazuki and wakes her from an enchanted slumber. Unfortunately, the girl who rises to greet him isn't who he had hoped for.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2004-11-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wfcixsTCV7n7li4EyzYhjSyEHm4.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wfcixsTCV7n7li4EyzYhjSyEHm4.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/27813/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"698896","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"With Kouhei at death's door, Hazuki agonizes over her attempt to kill him and is haunted by the relentless voice of her alter-ego, Mistress Luna. Is it truly her fate to lead a cursed life?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2004-12-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zCdlzophifxyhZlGpwDie5BF4A4.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zCdlzophifxyhZlGpwDie5BF4A4.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/27813/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"698897","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Concerned for her servant's health, Hazuki embraces her catty nature and rises to the challenge - Literally! But when Gramp's condition takes a turn for the worse, this kitty proves to have some fierce claws.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2004-12-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xkJEMgaBS0P8Y6rGkroeatKntTF.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xkJEMgaBS0P8Y6rGkroeatKntTF.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/27813/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"698898","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Kouhei, Seiji, and Hazuki must set aside their fears and travel to the little vampire's childhood home. As Kinkel warps reality, each turns against the other, forcing Hazuki to try and drive him away.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2004-12-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kEb1abPRoCgEsVorIP4AmRrXiJD.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kEb1abPRoCgEsVorIP4AmRrXiJD.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/27813/season/1/episode/12"},{"id":"698899","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":13,"title":{"value":"Episodio 13","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The battered heroes head out into the day to defeat Kinkel. But when a vampire has managed to survive for over 900 years, his death will not be an easy one. Whose bluff will be called in the end?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2004-12-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oCjMlbonjin8DGM73p9Lgp7tzPc.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oCjMlbonjin8DGM73p9Lgp7tzPc.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/27813/season/1/episode/13"},{"id":"698900","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":14,"title":{"value":"Episodio 14","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Hazuki's behavior is growing increasingly odd. While Elfriede wonders if she has turned to her alter-ego to escape her guilt, Kouhei realizes how much he misses the other side of Hazuki.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2005-01-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qQKitUkwhYSoK1iH3X8357colnr.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qQKitUkwhYSoK1iH3X8357colnr.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/27813/season/1/episode/14"},{"id":"698901","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":15,"title":{"value":"Episodio 15","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"With both sides of Hazuki battling for control, Elfriede convinces the young vampire to seek out another servant under the full moon's light. Kouhei heads out into the night after her.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2005-01-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zwiw4IzFIa8FCwcbOeRokeVpMuf.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zwiw4IzFIa8FCwcbOeRokeVpMuf.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/27813/season/1/episode/15"},{"id":"698902","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":16,"title":{"value":"Episodio 16","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Hazuki reveals yet another hidden talent: the ability to suppress her presence. In her absolute stillness, Kouhei finds the perfect subject for his photography. Unfortunately, Hazuki's self-doubt soon creeps in.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2005-01-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/efik3efYi0UpnyroiAId7Z7czl3.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/efik3efYi0UpnyroiAId7Z7czl3.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/27813/season/1/episode/16"},{"id":"698903","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":17,"title":{"value":"Episodio 17","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"During the quiet hours of the night, Elfriede unburdens her soul to Gramps. Kouhei, feeling powerless to protect Hazuki should another vampire come after them, decides to take his training into his own hands.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2005-02-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9K0kiMXGH49vCpVDzJhmBqsnVQh.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9K0kiMXGH49vCpVDzJhmBqsnVQh.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/27813/seas